  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{次|つ}ぐ + noun: second only to X (⟦{東京|とうきょう}→東京：09564_toukyou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{次|つ}ぐ⟦{大都市|だいとし}→大都市：12204_daitoshi⟧)\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{次|つ}いで: after X, next to X (⟦{日本|にほん}→日本：03876_nihon⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{次|つ}いで)\n- X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{次|つ}ぐX: X after X (⟦{成功|せいこう}→成功：02638_seikou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{次|つ}ぐ⟦{成功|せいこう}→成功：02638_seikou⟧)\n- ⟦{相次|あいつ}ぐ→相次ぐ：14869_aitsugu⟧: to happen one after another\n\nWATCH OUT:\nSame reading, different verbs: ⟦{継|つ}ぐ→継ぐ：02292_tsugu⟧ (to inherit, take over: ⟦{家業|かぎょう}→家業：12353_kagyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{継|つ}ぐ→継ぐ：02292_tsugu⟧), ⟦{注|つ}ぐ→注ぐ：02470_tsugu⟧ (to pour), ⟦{接|つ}ぐ→接ぐ：02471_tsugu⟧ (to join, graft). {次|つ}ぐ is only \"to rank or come next\" and takes ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧, not ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nIntransitive: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{次|つ}ぐ.",
